      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start and looks very clean. \n\nI just ran it through the QC tool real quick to see where we stand, and the score is actually pretty low (current score: 6). It's probably going to get kicked back by the automated gate since it's not looking \"complex\" enough for the system requirements.\n\nI don't want you to make it messy or add nonsense, but could you expand on this a bit? Maybe break the sections down into more sub-steps or add more specific detail to the installation and setup parts? Just try to bump that score up a bit through better organization so it clears the gatehands, while still keeping it a professional guide. Can you try a second version?",
      "source": "evaluator"
